BT 1 0 0 1 0 189.888 Tm .919 Tw 18 TL /F4 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (2024 Bar Q: "Flavio obtained from Safe Assurance Corporation \(SAC\), through its agent) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.38 Tw (Laureen, a fire insurance policy over his residential house for a period of one year from) Tj T* 0 Tw 4.189714 Tw (August 25, 2024 to August 24, 2025. Flavio delivered on August 26, 2024 a check) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.5024 Tw (representing premium payment to Laureen who then issued an acknowledgment receipt.) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.64 Tw (On August 27, 2024, a fire completely razed Flavio's house. Oblivious of the incident,) Tj T* 0 Tw .832286 Tw (Laureen deposited the check on August 28, 2024 to SAC's bank account and was credited) Tj T* 0 Tw .950769 Tw (on the same day. Thereafter, Flavio filed against SAC an insurance claim. However, SAC) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.6024 Tw (denied the claim and argued that there was no payment of premium yet to make the) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.313714 Tw (insurance policy effective at the time of the loss. SAC explained that it received the) Tj T* 0 Tw .0645 Tw (premium payment only on August 28, 2024 or after the fire occurred on August 27, 2024. Is) Tj T* 0 Tw (there a valid and binding insurance contract between SAC and Flavio? Explain.") Tj T* ET
