BT 1 0 0 1 0 261.804 Tm .8248 Tw 18 TL /F2 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: Yes. A valid and binding insurance contract exists between SAC and Flavio, and SAC must) Tj T* 0 Tw (pay for the razed house.) Tj  T* 1.9176 Tw (Under Sections 77 and 78 of the Insurance Code, premium is earned on exposure and cover) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.621538 Tw (attaches upon a perfected contract plus exposure within the policy period, applied with the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.369 Tw (agency rule, under which premium delivered to the authorized agent with an acknowledgment) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.8696 Tw (receipt is payment to the insurer itself. An insurer that collects premium through its agent is) Tj T* 0 Tw .718286 Tw (estopped from denying payment on internal-timing grounds, as in Qua Chee Gan v. Law Union) Tj T* 0 Tw (and Rock Insurance Co. \(G.R. No. L-4611, 1955\).) Tj  T* .795 Tw (Here, Flavio delivered his check to Laureen on August 26, 2024, inside the August 25, 2024 to) Tj T* 0 Tw .221143 Tw (August 24, 2025 term, and Laureen issued an acknowledgment receipt before the August 27 fire.) Tj T* 0 Tw .6032 Tw (The August 28 deposit and crediting are merely internal timing that does not move the payment) Tj T* 0 Tw .418154 Tw (date back. The counter-reading that payment happened only on August 28 fails because delivery) Tj T* 0 Tw (to the authorized agent was complete on August 26.) Tj  T* .98325 Tw (The denial therefore fails. The contract is valid, the August 27 loss fell within cover, and SAC) Tj T* 0 Tw (must pay.) Tj T* ET
