BT 1 0 0 1 0 135.804 Tm 1.8795 Tw 18 TL /F2 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: No. The denial is improper. GIC is deemed to have known of the cancer history through ) Tj T* 0 Tw .6728 Tw (Gabriela, its approving officer, so there is no concealment against it, and the policy had already ) Tj T* 0 Tw (become incontestable months before Diego died.) Tj ( ) Tj T* .142588 Tw (Under Secs. 26 to 28 and 31 of the Insurance Code, concealment is the neglect to communicate a ) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.41 Tw (known material fact which the other has no means of ascertaining, with materiality judged by ) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.3616 Tw (probable influence on underwriting and not by the event. Under Sec. 48, after a life policy ) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.5165 Tw (payable on death has been in force during the insured's lifetime for two years from issue, the ) Tj T* 0 Tw 5.127273 Tw (insurer cannot prove voidness ab initio or rescindibility for fraudulent concealment or) Tj T* 0 Tw ET
