BT 1 0 0 1 0 351.804 Tm 2.3192 Tw 18 TL /F2 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: All three defenses succeed. The rescission declared after loss and after suit is barred by) Tj T* 0 Tw (waiver, by estoppel, and by untimeliness, so the insurer must pay.) Tj  T* .849176 Tw (Under Sec. 48 of the Insurance Code, a right to rescind given by the chapter must be exercised) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.675385 Tw (before commencement of action on the contract. Under the waiver and estoppel doctrines, an) Tj T* 0 Tw .54675 Tw (insurer that collects premiums with knowledge of the ground for forfeiture waives it, as La O v.) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.3995 Tw (Yek Tong Lin Fire and Marine \(G.R. No. 33131, 1930\) holds, and an insurer that by conduct) Tj T* 0 Tw .568615 Tw (recognizes the policy with knowledge is estopped from contradicting that position, as Qua Chee) Tj T* 0 Tw .456706 Tw (Gan v. Law Union and Rock Insurance \(G.R. No. L-4611, 1955\) holds. After two years of a life) Tj T* 0 Tw .46725 Tw (policy in force, fraud defenses are further barred under Sec. 48, as Manila Bankers Life v. Aban) Tj T* 0 Tw (\(G.R. No. 175666, 2013\) holds.) Tj  T* .67425 Tw (Here the insurer learned of the concealment in Year 1, kept collecting premiums for a full year,) Tj T* 0 Tw .1864 Tw (then waited until after loss and after the beneficiary sued before declaring rescission. The year of) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.964 Tw (post-knowledge collection shows intentional relinquishment and induced reliance, satisfying) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.866 Tw (both waiver and estoppel. The post-suit declaration violates the previous-to-action rule on its) Tj T* 0 Tw .105429 Tw (face. The counter-reading that a real concealment survives any delay fails because Sec. 48 makes) Tj T* 0 Tw .643636 Tw (timeliness a separate procedural bar and knowledge plus collection independently relinquish the) Tj T* 0 Tw (right.) Tj  T* .034154 Tw (Rescission is therefore ineffective on three independent grounds. The insurer is barred by waiver,) Tj T* 0 Tw .980571 Tw (estoppel, and timeliness, with incontestability as an added bar where its requisites are met, and) Tj T* 0 Tw (the claim must be paid.) Tj T* ET
