BT 1 0 0 1 0 279.804 Tm .8248 Tw 18 TL /F2 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: The insurer must pay no-fault indemnity of at least P15,000.00 on the sworn papers without) Tj T* 0 Tw .594667 Tw (proof of fault, it may not exact a full quitclaim for that payment, and the suit filed eight months) Tj T* 0 Tw (after denial is timely.) Tj  T* 2.00475 Tw (Under Sec. 391 of the Insurance Code, death or injury claims pay without proof of fault on) Tj T* 0 Tw .4032 Tw (sworn police report plus death or medical proofs, with total indemnity of at least P15,000.00 per) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.243143 Tw (person and the occupant claim lying against the ridden vehicle and other claims against the) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.284 Tw (directly offending vehicle. Under Sec. 398 the insurer ascertains and pays promptly without) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.291714 Tw (compelling a quitclaim for the no-fault balance, and under Sec. 397 the claim requires written) Tj T* 0 Tw (notice within six months while suit prescribes one year from denial.) Tj  T* 1.385143 Tw (Here, the sworn police report plus P40,000 hospital receipts satisfy Sec. 391, so the fault-first) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.337538 Tw (refusal and the full-quitclaim demand both violate the no-fault track, while eight months from) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.702 Tw (denial sits inside the one-year suit period. The counter-reading that no-fault needs negligence) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.433143 Tw (proof or buys total peace mistakes the P15,000.00 floor for a ceiling and the prompt-payment) Tj T* 0 Tw (duty for a settlement.) Tj  T* 2.839714 Tw (The insurer must therefore pay no-fault now, litigate any excess on fault without a forced) Tj T* 0 Tw (quitclaim, and face a timely action, because the papers, floor, and calendar all favor the victim.) Tj T* ET
