BT 1 0 0 1 0 135.804 Tm .385714 Tw 18 TL /F2 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (Facts: Jewel Villacorta owned a 1976 Colt Lancer insured with Empire under Private Car Policy) Tj T* 0 Tw 4.372 Tw (No. MBI/PC-0704 for P35,000.00 own damage, P30,000.00 theft, P30,000.00 third-party) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.04 Tw (liability, May 16, 1977 to May 16, 1978. On May 9, 1978 she left it with Sunday Machine) Tj T* 0 Tw .369 Tw (Works for check-up and repairs. On May 11, 1978, while in the shop's custody, six persons took) Tj T* 0 Tw .315692 Tw (it to Montalban, Rizal, where driver Benito Mabasa crashed into a parked gravel-and-sand truck.) Tj T* 0 Tw .080571 Tw (Mabasa and one passenger died, four were injured, and the car was extensively damaged. Empire) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.213455 Tw (denied the total-loss claim. The Insurance Commission dismissed the complaint, holding the) Tj T* 0 Tw (driver was not an authorized driver and the taking was a mere temporary joy ride, hence no theft.) Tj T* ET
