BT 1 0 0 1 0 225.804 Tm .929538 Tw 18 TL /F2 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: Villacorta recovers on both the own-damage and theft covers, so the Insurance Commission ) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.022 Tw (dismissal must be set aside and the remedy from the adverse ruling is a Sec. 439 appeal to the ) Tj T* 0 Tw (Court of Appeals.) Tj ( ) Tj T* 1.159385 Tw (Under Sec. 439 of the Insurance Code, the Commissioner adjudicates an insured claim against ) Tj T* 0 Tw .552 Tw (the insurer up to P5,000,000.00 per single claim with a notice of appeal to the Court of Appeals ) Tj T* 0 Tw 9.518182 Tw (filed with the Commissioner within thirty \(30\) days from receipt. Under the ) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.206 Tw (adhesion-construction doctrine applied in Jewel Villacorta v. Insurance Commission \(G.R. No. ) Tj T* 0 Tw .955714 Tw (L-54171, 1980\), policy ambiguity is resolved strictly against the insurer. Under Art. 308 of the ) Tj T* 0 Tw (Revised Penal Code, unlawful taking without consent is theft because use itself is gain.) Tj ( ) Tj T* 2.265231 Tw (Here, Villacorta entrusted her Colt Lancer key to Sunday Machine Works for check-up and ) Tj T* 0 Tw .031385 Tw (repairs and shop employee Benito Mabasa drove it to Montalban without consent before crashing ) Tj T* 0 Tw .312 Tw (it into a parked truck. The entrustment presumptively authorized legitimate driving by a licensed ) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.22 Tw (driver so the diversion to an illicit purpose did not breach the authorized-driver clause. The) Tj T* 0 Tw ET
