BT 1 0 0 1 0 315.804 Tm .09075 Tw 18 TL /F2 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: The beneficiary of the matured education plan collects delay interest at twice the legal rate for) Tj T* 0 Tw (the forty-five-day delay plus Sec. 28 litigation damages on a successful enforcement suit.) Tj  T* 1.6728 Tw (Under Sec. 26 paragraph 1 of RA 9829, scheduled benefit plans such as education plans pay) Tj T* 0 Tw .527143 Tw (immediately upon maturity, with installments or annuities as they fall due, and refusal or failure) Tj T* 0 Tw .4215 Tw (to pay within fifteen days from maturity entitles the beneficiary to interest at twice the legal rate) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.147714 Tw (for the delay unless the claim is fraudulent and the planholder complied with the documentary) Tj T* 0 Tw .672 Tw (requirements. Under Sec. 28, the Commission determines in any enforcement litigation whether) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.432727 Tw (denial or withholding was unreasonable, and unreasonable delay draws actual damages plus) Tj T* 0 Tw .5265 Tw (attorney fees and legal interest from claim date to full satisfaction. Under Sec. 28, failure to pay) Tj T* 0 Tw (within the Sec. 26 time is prima facie evidence of unreasonable delay.) Tj  T* .174 Tw (Here, the education plan matured on a date fixed at purchase, which makes it a scheduled benefit) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.1392 Tw (plan under Sec. 4\(q\) rather than a contingent plan. The sixty-day payment delay with no fraud) Tj T* 0 Tw .44325 Tw (leaves forty-five compensable days from day sixteen to day sixty at twice the legal rate. That no) Tj T* 0 Tw .7155 Tw (fraud tainted the claim removes only the Sec. 26 fraud defense and never the delay price, while) Tj T* 0 Tw .085846 Tw (the missed fifteen-day clock supplies the prima facie unreasonableness case for Sec. 28 damages.) Tj T* 0 Tw (Documentary compliance is assumed on the stated facts, so the interest entitlement stands.) Tj  T* 1.04 Tw (The beneficiary therefore recovers twice-legal-interest for the delay period, and a court finding) Tj T* 0 Tw (of unreasonableness adds actual damages with attorney fees and running legal interest.) Tj T* ET
